_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_03_43","text":"You've got a long day ahead of you tomorrow, so get some rest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda_b","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soda_twinklingbunny_03_44","text":"Gotcha! You get some rest too, Master!","jump":null}],"chat":true}